+# Tasks: crash- and network-safe local meeting capture
+
+**Issue:** `d88d461a-c259-4dc6-a751-f2b3c6898b7a`
+**Plan:** [`plan.md`](./plan.md)
+**State:** Human DEV checkpoint; no DEV until `ce3127d7...` lands and this amended plan is approved
+**Delivery:** Seven sequential, independently reversible PRs; each <=300 changed production-code lines excluding tests/docs/generated files/lockfiles
+
+## Non-negotiable dependency and DEV gate
+
+Before any task product code:
+
+1. Re-prove the live d88 Forge lease under the DEV actor and rebase on current `origin/main`.
+2. Verify `ce3127d7-2ae0-4eff-aa37-1101762d0d0b` is separately human-approved, merged, and present at an exact recorded `origin/main` SHA.
+3. Copy its exact canonical ledger/repository/adapter paths and contract version into the d88 issue. Those paths become server PR ownership; no path is invented in this task list.
+4. Verify unique session/sequence plus digest, raw+ledger commit ACK, `reserved/processing/acknowledged/failed`, contiguous watermark/gaps, immutable terminal intent, consent/provenance/retention/deletion, concurrency/idempotency, migration/rollback/security evidence, an immutable raw-slice read handle/stream, and durable post-commit STT work claiming with startup recovery.
+5. Verify dependency RED/GREEN evidence for crash after raw ACK before scheduling, restart sweep, missing/expired raw object, duplicate worker delivery, and retention-versus-processing races.
+6. Reject `jobs.payload`, in-memory, filename/metadata, raw SQL, or second-authority fallbacks.
+7. Human approves the seven gates in `plan.md` and authorizes PR1 only.
